      "name": "Dev note / nFS6A / REGISTRATION · Verify email",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Verify email\n\nEmail OTP verification before the optional passkey offer. Once a passkey is set up, normal sign-in must use it instead of email OTP."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "S79Xcy",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7028.1900250402505,
      "name": "Dev note / ZYW0K / REGISTRATION · Optional passkey setup",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Optional passkey setup\n\nSet Up Passkey starts phone verification and creation. Not Now continues registration using email OTP; setup can be completed later in Settings."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "tVvEp",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 7028.1900250402505,
      "name": "Dev note / gT4o2 / REGISTRATION · Enter phone number",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Enter phone number\n\nCollect a phone number for OTP verification. Send Code opens code entry. Save the verified number in the profile before creating the passkey."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "o70fci",
      "x": 6213,
      "y": 7028.1900250402505,
      "name": "Dev note / O6pgR / REGISTRATION · Phone code entered",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Phone code entered\n\nSix digits entered; validate the code. Success verifies the phone and continues to creation. Invalid or expired code stays on verification."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "jAxXM",
      "x": 7752,
      "y": 7028.1900250402505,
      "name": "Dev note / RPVg3 / REGISTRATION · Phone code rejected",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Phone code rejected\n\nAlternative state of phone verification. Show the error beneath the code fields and stay on this step. Retry or request a new code."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "cfhFW",
      "x": 9286,
      "y": 7028.1900250402505,
      "name": "Dev note / lxcXR / REGISTRATION · System passkey creation",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · System passkey creation\n\nShow while the device prompts the user to create a passkey. A verified phone is required. Success must also save the key in the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "T54xQ",
      "x": 3132,
      "y": 7028.1900250402505,
      "name": "Dev note / uHuRL / REGISTRATION · Verify phone code",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Verify phone code\n\nEnter the code sent to the shown number. Valid code verifies the phone before passkey creation. Resend requests another code; Change Phone Number returns to number entry."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "rnUr3",
      "x": 4663,
      "y": 7028.1900250402505,
      "name": "Dev note / yRhj4 / REGISTRATION · Resend cooldown",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Resend cooldown\n\nAlternative OTP state after requesting another code. Resend stays disabled during the countdown, then becomes available again."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "DrJH8",
      "x": 10813,
      "y": 7028,
      "name": "Dev note / vwN6K / REGISTRATION · Passkey created",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Passkey created\n\nPasskey created and saved. Continue onboarding; future sign-in uses the passkey instead of email OTP."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "qyUHz",
      "x": 12340,
      "y": 7028,
      "name": "Dev note / weKnN / REGISTRATION · Creation failed",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "REGISTRATION · Creation failed\n\nTechnical error during passkey creation. Try Again restarts creation. System-prompt cancellation is not a technical failure."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "B2FXm2",
      "x": 80,
