      "name": "Dev note / X8RNpg / PLAID LINKING · Passkey required",
      "width": 620,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "PLAID LINKING · Passkey required\n\nBefore the first Plaid account connection, require a passkey. Start setup to verify the phone and create a key; Cancel exits this prerequisite."
    },
